== Trivia ==
* Endogeny is the first monster to lose its [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Basic Basic] Rarity after its introduction in Beta 30.0.
* Endogeny's loss of being a Dog is shared with [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Lemon_Bread Lemon Bread]'s loss of being a [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Category:Mold Mold].
** Beta 41.1 also made [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Reaper_Bird Reaper Bird] a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Frog Frog], but it wasn't one before.
* Due to its sprite being so big, it had to be altered several times in order to fit well on the card. This wasn't done during the (big) Sprite Change updates like Betas 21.1 or 33.0, which is why they are left out on this page.
** Each individual group image instead shows the biggest changes between each, even if that sprite wasn't used during that particular period of time.
